messages:
I am a Subway Boss, Ingo.{be01}
The fellow over to the side is
also a Subway Boss, Emmet.{be01}
Will a Multi Battle help us cover
each other's weakness?{be01}
Or will you show your
overwhelming power?{be01}
I look forward to seeing
how well you fight.{be01}
However, it is difficult to win
unless you and your partner{be00}
are in total sync.

We make a good two-car train,
Ingo and Emmet.{be01}
This time, we worked together toward
a victory.{be01}
However, your abilities are
very impressive.

Bravo!!{be01}
What you showed us is
a spark as Trainers.{be01}
However, let me say just one thing.{be01}
Winning against us is a milestone
in your life.{be01}
You can rack up more and more.{be01}
Please move on toward an even
greater goal!
